{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And the sons of Merari.</b> They were two sons, no more. Therefore it says, \"These are the families of Levi according to their generations,\" for those who went down to Egypt did not beget [more than] these—the sons of Jacob. He also mentioned the years of Amram's life on account of the honor of his sons."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:10.989474853Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}